  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Major release: typed OfferingDto.Metadata and dead-field cleanup on PricingDto.\n\nNEW\n- OfferingDto.Metadata is now IReadOnlyDictionary<string, JsonElement>, giving callers type-safe access to RevenueCat dashboard metadata via System.Text.Json. Nested objects, arrays, numbers, and booleans round-trip without flattening.\n\nBREAKING\n- OfferingDto.Metadata type changed from string? (JSON-serialized) to IReadOnlyDictionary<string, JsonElement>. Callers that previously parsed the JSON string with JsonSerializer.Deserialize can now index the dictionary directly and use JsonElement helpers such as GetString(), GetInt32(), GetProperty(...). Empty metadata is now ImmutableDictionary<string, JsonElement>.Empty instead of null.\n- PricingDto: removed OriginalPrice, OriginalPriceMicros, OriginalPriceLocalized — these were never populated by iOS or Android SDK mappers and always returned default values, so no real data is lost. Callers reading them should drop the references.",
